config LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_463_SENSOR_APP
	bool "Contest 2026 team 463 sensor app (QMI8658A)"
	default n
	---help---
		Enable the QMI8658A 6-axis IMU data acquisition demo.
		Reads accelerometer and gyroscope raw register values
		via I2C and prints to console. No attitude calculation.
